      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It happens specifically when the controllers get close to something you can interact with. For example your camera or anything else like buttons or pickupable items. This bug was persistent back in August last year for almost an entire month where the outline was visible all the time regardless or where the controllers were. It was finally fixed partially. It still happened randomly. In order to try to \"fix\" the issue one  had to restart the game multiple times until randomly at one point it wouldn't happen. Lately it seems it happens more often to the extent that I can't remember when was it the last time that it didn't.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
