      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "If you're taking a photo and don't want it to show up in the photo there is an inconvenient workaround. If you keep the camera in your hand for, I don't know exactly, more than 10-ish seconds, the outline will eventually disappear. And then you can take the photo.",
